---
const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/').replace(/\/+$/, '');
const appUrl = (import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL || 'http://localhost:8000').replace(/\/$/, '');
const loginUrl = `${appUrl}/login`;
const questions = [
  ['What is Koamishin Portal?', 'Koamishin Portal is an identity portal for accounts and connected applications.'],
  ['How do I access my account?', 'Use the sign in link to open the portal. The options available to you depend on how your organization has configured it.'],
  ['Can I create an account?', 'Registration is available when it has been enabled by the portal administrator.'],
  ['Can I use a passkey or two factor authentication?', 'The portal supports passkeys and two factor authentication when those features are enabled and configured.'],
  ['What if I forget my password?', 'Use the password reset option on the sign in page if it is available for your account.'],
  ['Can applications connect to the portal?', 'Administrators can configure applications to use the portal’s OAuth endpoints.'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Koamishin Portal brings account access and connected applications together in one identity portal." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f4ee" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${base}/koamishin-logo.svg`} />
    <title>Koamishin Portal | A place for your account</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="header shell">
      <a class="brand" href={`${base}/`} aria-label="Koamishin Portal home"><img src={`${base}/koamishin-logo.svg`} alt="" width="36" height="36" /><span>koamishin<span class="brand-light"> / portal</span></span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#questions">Questions</a><a class="docs-link" href={`${base}/docs/`}>Documentation</a><a class="nav-link" href={loginUrl}>Sign in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> YOUR ACCOUNT, IN ONE PLACE</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">A clearer way<br />to connect.</h1>
          <p class="hero-description">Koamishin Portal brings your account and connected applications together, so you have a familiar place to sign in and manage your details.</p>
          <a class="button" href={loginUrl}>Sign in to the portal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p class="hero-note">For people and the applications they use.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="art-top"><span>KOAMISHIN PORTAL</span><span>IDENTITY / ACCESS</span></div>
          <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="orbit orbit-three"></div>
          <div class="art-center"><img src="/koamishin-logo.svg" alt="" width="72" height="72" /><span>YOUR ACCOUNT</span></div>
          <span class="art-node node-one">01 <b>ACCOUNT</b></span><span class="art-node node-two">02 <b>ACCESS</b></span><span class="art-node node-three">03 <b>APPLICATIONS</b></span>
          <div class="art-bottom"><span>ONE PLACE TO BEGIN</span><span>● &nbsp; CONNECTED</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="about" class="intro shell">
        <div class="section-label"><span>01 / THE PORTAL</span><span>MADE FOR CONNECTION</span></div>
        <div class="intro-grid"><h2>One account.<br /><span>More possibilities.</span></h2><p>Start with your account, then use the applications connected to your portal. The experience and available sign in methods are shaped by your organization’s configuration.</p></div>
        <div class="features">
          <article><span class="feature-number">01</span><div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><h3>A familiar starting point</h3><p>Return to one place to sign in and access your account details.</p></article>
          <article><span class="feature-number">02</span><div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div><h3>Account controls</h3><p>Manage your profile and, where enabled, add ways to protect your account.</p></article>
          <article><span class="feature-number">03</span><div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</div><h3>Connected applications</h3><p>Applications can use the portal’s identity endpoints to connect account access.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="statement"><div class="shell statement-inner"><p class="eyebrow">THE IDEA IS SIMPLE</p><h2>A place for your identity.<br /><span>A starting point for what’s next.</span></h2><a href={loginUrl}>Go to sign in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
      <section id="questions" class="faq shell"><div class="section-label"><span>02 / GOOD TO KNOW</span><span>QUESTIONS &amp; ANSWERS</span></div><div class="faq-grid"><div><h2>A little more<br />about the portal.</h2><p>What you can use depends on the settings chosen by your administrator.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{questions.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
      <section class="closing shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</p><h2>Your account is<br />a click away.</h2></div><a class="button button-light" href={loginUrl}>Sign in to the portal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer shell"><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><img src={`${base}/koamishin-logo.svg`} alt="" width="32" height="32" /><span>koamishin<span class="brand-light"> / portal</span></span></a><p>Account access, thoughtfully connected.</p><a href="#main">Back to top ↑</a></footer>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
  :root{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;color:#20241f;background:#f5f4ee;font-synthesis:none;scroll-behavior:smooth}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}p,h1,h2,h3{margin:0}p{text-wrap:pretty}h1,h2,h3{text-wrap:balance}button,a,summary{outline-offset:4px}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c85d36}.shell{width:min(100% - 64px,1280px);margin-inline:auto}.skip{position:absolute;left:16px;top:-80px;background:#fff;padding:12px;z-index:10}.skip:focus{top:16px}.header{height:96px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.04em}.brand img{border-radius:8px}.brand-light{font-weight:400;color:#777c72}.header nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.header nav a:not(.nav-link){color:#656b60}.nav-link{border:1px solid #c7cbc0;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 16px}.nav-link span,.button span{margin-left:24px}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;padding:48px 0 96px}.hero-copy{padding:32px 0}.eyebrow,.section-label,.art-top,.art-bottom,.art-node,.feature-number{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.eyebrow{color:#70786d}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#cc633e;margin-right:8px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,80px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:24px 0;color:#20241f}.hero-description{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#676e63;max-width:520px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#252c24;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-top:32px;transition:background 180ms cubic-bezier(.32,.72,0,1),transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.32,.72,0,1)}.button:hover{background:#435441}.button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.hero-note{font-size:12px;color:#8a8f84;margin-top:24px}.hero-art{height:520px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#dce4d6;border-radius:12px;color:#394b3a}.art-top,.art-bottom{position:absolute;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em}.art-top{top:24px}.art-bottom{bottom:24px}.orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid #b8c9b6;border-radius:50%;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.orbit-one{width:220px;height:220px}.orbit-two{width:360px;height:360px}.orbit-three{width:500px;height:500px}.art-center{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.art-center img{box-shadow:0 16px 32px #83957e55;border-radius:18px}.art-node{position:absolute;background:#f5f4ee;border:1px solid #c2d0bd;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:10px;color:#879585;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #72876e1a}.art-node b{color:#40513f;margin-left:8px}.node-one{top:19%;left:12%}.node-two{top:38%;right:8%}.node-three{bottom:20%;left:15%}.intro{padding:32px 0 96px}.section-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #d2d5ca;padding-top:24px;color:#82897d}.intro-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:end;margin:80px 0 64px}.intro h2,.faq h2,.closing h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,60px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.055em}.intro h2 span,.statement h2 span{color:#899387}.intro-grid>p,.faq-grid>div>p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#6a7267;max-width:490px}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.features article{background:#ebece4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;min-height:280px}.feature-number{color:#929b8d}.feature-icon{font-size:30px;margin:40px 0 24px;color:#6e8269}.features h3{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.features p{color:#6d756a;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;margin-top:12px;max-width:300px}.statement{background:#303d31;color:#f6f6ee}.statement-inner{padding:96px 0}.statement .eyebrow{color:#a9b8a6}.statement h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,60px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:32px 0}.statement h2 span{color:#aab9a5}.statement a{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid #aab9a5;padding-bottom:8px}.statement a span{margin-left:32px}.faq{padding:96px 0}.faq-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;margin-top:80px}.faq-grid>div>p{font-size:16px;margin-top:24px}.faq-list details{border-top:1px solid #d2d5ca;padding:24px 0}.faq-list details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #d2d5ca}.faq-list summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}.faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq-list summary span{font-size:24px;font-weight:400;color:#81917d}.faq-list details[open] summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}.faq-list details p{color:#6a7267;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:16px;max-width:520px}.closing{background:#dce4d6;border-radius:12px;padding:64px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:32px}.closing h2{margin-top:24px}.button-light{margin:0}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:64px 0;font-size:12px;color:#7e857a}.footer .brand{color:#20241f}.footer>a:last-child{font-weight:700;color:#434b40}@media(max-width:800px){.shell{width:min(100% - 40px,1280px)}.header{height:80px}.header nav{gap:16px}.header nav a:not(.nav-link):not(.docs-link){display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px 0 64px}.hero-copy{padding:24px 0}.hero-art{height:400px}.intro{padding-bottom:64px}.intro-grid,.faq-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin:48px 0}.features{grid-template-columns:1fr}.features article{min-height:0}.feature-icon{margin:24px 0}.statement-inner{padding:64px 0}.faq{padding:64px 0}.faq-grid{margin-bottom:0}.closing{padding:32px;align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.footer{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;padding:48px 0}.art-node{font-size:9px}.section-label{font-size:10px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:root{scroll-behavior:auto}.button{transition:none}}
</style>
